  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "His mother's grave was cold before his boots wore thin",
      "bar": 1,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the men who called him puny would learn to run",
      "bar": 3,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "he stood five foot seven with a temper like a struck match",
      "bar": 5,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "first blood at seventeen, and the trouble had begun",
      "bar": 7,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },

    {
      "text": "Tunstall gave him work and gave him something like a home",
      "bar": 9,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "the only roof a drifting boy could trust",
      "bar": 11,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "they shot the Englishman down on a New Mexico road",
      "bar": 13,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "and every gentle thing the Kid had built turned into dust",
      "bar": 15,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },

    {
      "text": "Billy, Billy, faster than sin",
      "bar": 17,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "they write his name wherever the bullet's been",
      "bar": 19,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "the law calls it murder, the ballad calls it fate",
      "bar": 21,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "and New Mexico's never made peace with the debate",
      "bar": 23,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus"
    },

    {
      "text": "They say he killed a man for every year he'd lived",
      "bar": 25,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "twenty-one notches by the time he hit the ground",
      "bar": 27,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "that's the kind of arithmetic a legend needs to breathe",
      "bar": 29,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "truer than the truth and twice as widely passed around",
      "bar": 31,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },

    {
      "text": "Billy, Billy, faster than sin",
      "bar": 33,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "they write his name wherever the bullet's been",
      "bar": 35,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "the law calls it murder, the ballad calls it fate",
      "bar": 37,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "and New Mexico's never made peace with the debate",
      "bar": 39,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },

    {
      "text": "Two men stood at the door",
      "bar": 41,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "now there's two men less than before",
      "bar": 42,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "he walked out whistling low",
      "bar": 43,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "into a night that let him go",
      "bar": 44,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "bridge"
    },

    {
      "text": "Pat Garrett knew the moon better than he knew the man",
      "bar": 45,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse4"
    },
    {
      "text": "and waited in a borrowed house for one footstep in the dark",
      "bar": 47,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse4"
    },
    {
      "text": "one shot in Pete Maxwell's room, and the legend split in two",
      "bar": 49,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse4"
    },
    {
      "text": "the boy who died at twenty-one, and the one that left a mark",
      "bar": 51,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse4"
    },

